  "text_md": "# Table S1: Statistical results of the Shapiro (W), Pearson correlation (r) and holm Bonferroni tests, with their p values, applied on our dataset of metal concentrations in the different bat tissues and soil concentrations (NSRI dataset).\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Metal</td>\n    <td>Statistical test</td>\n    <td>Kidneys</td>\n    <td>Liver</td>\n    <td>Stomach</td>\n    <td>Bones</td>\n    <td>Soil</td>\n    <td>Fur</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\">Cd</td>\n    <td>Shapiro W P value</td>\n    <td>0.46 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.15 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.27 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.13 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.46 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.05 < 2.2e-16</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Pearson r p value</td>\n    <td>0.37 4.058e-07</td>\n    <td>0.23 0.002257</td>\n    <td>0.54 5.358e-13</td>\n    <td>0.53 2.887e-14</td>\n    <td>0.10 0.1846</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Bonferroni Adjusted p value</td>\n    <td>1.2174e-06</td>\n    <td>4.5140e-03</td>\n    <td>2.1432e-12</td>\n    <td>1.4435e-13</td>\n    <td>1.8460e-01</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\">Cu</td>\n    <td>Shapiro test W P value</td>\n    <td>0.56 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.63 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.40 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.63 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.40 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.68 < 2.2e-16</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Pearson r p value</td>\n    <td>0.39 2.066e-08</td>\n    <td>0.24 0.0009522</td>\n    <td>0.41 5.346e-08</td>\n    <td>0.25 0.0004402</td>\n    <td>0.09 0.2359</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Bonferroni Adjusted p value</td>\n    <td>1.0330e-07</td>\n    <td>1.9044e-03</td>\n    <td>2.1384e-07</td>\n    <td>1.3206e-03</td>\n    <td>2.3590e-01</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\">Pb</td>\n    <td>Shapiro test W P value</td>\n    <td>0.35 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.13 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.33 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.73 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.41 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.17 < 2.2e-16</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Pearson r p value</td>\n    <td>0.42<br>1.367e-09<br></td>\n    <td>0.10 0.1934</td>\n    <td>0.75 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.72 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.04 0.5742</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Bonferroni Adjusted p value</td>\n    <td>4.101e-09</td>\n    <td>3.868e-01</td>\n    <td>1.100e-15</td>\n    <td>1.100e-15</td>\n    <td>5.742e-01</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\">Zn</td>\n    <td>Shapiro test W P value</td>\n    <td>0.55 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.21 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.19 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.88 3.833e-11</td>\n    <td>0.37 < 2.2e-16</td>\n    <td>0.66 < 2.2e-16</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Pearson r p value</td>\n    <td>0.19 0.007064</td>\n    <td>-0.07 0.346</td>\n    <td>0.39 2.301e-07</td>\n    <td>0.36 2.24e-07</td>\n    <td>0.04 0.5378</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Bonferroni Adjusted p value</td>\n    <td>0.02119200</td>\n    <td>0.69200000</td>\n    <td>0.00000112</td>\n    <td>0.00000112</td>\n    <td>0.69200000</td>\n    <td>-</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n",
